!Sample_supplementary_file_1 = NONE
!Sample_series_id = GSE222650
!Sample_series_id = GSE222652
!Sample_data_row_count = 0
^SAMPLE = GSM6928344
!Sample_title = miRNA-Seq FZX_Le_M3
!Sample_geo_accession = GSM6928344
!Sample_status = Public on Feb 06 2023
!Sample_submission_date = Jan 11 2023
!Sample_last_update_date = Feb 06 2023
!Sample_type = SRA
!Sample_channel_count = 1
!Sample_source_name_ch1 = leaves
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Litchi chinensis
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 151069
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = tissue: leaves
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = strain: mock
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = genotype: Feizixiao
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: Sterile water (Mock-inoculation)
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = time: 24h
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Lychee leaves and fruits were inoculated with P.litchii (1 × 104 spores·mL−1) or mock (sterile water).
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Lychee trees were planted in National lychee Germplasm Nursery located in Institute of Fruit Tree Research Guangdong Academy of Agricultural Sciences.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Total RNA was extracted from the treated leaves by Plant RNA Kit (Promega, LS1040).
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = The small RNA library (sRNA library) was constructed according to the manufacturer’s instruction of TrueSeq small RNA library prep kit (Illumina San Diego CA, USA), and 2.5 ng RNA per sample was used as the initial amount. The T4 RNA Ligase 1 was ligated to the 3′ end of the RNA, followed by the ligation of T4 RNA Ligase 2 (truncated) to the 5′ adapter. After that, the RNA was reverse transcribed to synthesize cDNA. Finally, small RNA libraries were obtained by screening these recovered fragments using gel separation technology. The qualities of the library was further tested following these steps: 1) Initial quantification was performed using Qubit 2.0, and the insert size of the library was tested using Agilent 2100. 2) The Q-PCR method was used to accurately quantify the effective concentration of the library (effective library concentration > 2 nM). After the library's quality tests were passed, the library performed pooling according to the amount of target data, followed by sequencing on the Illumina Nova platform.
!Sample_description = FZX_Le_M3
!Sample_description = Mock treatment
!Sample_data_processing = Illumina Casava1.8 software used for basecalling.
!Sample_data_processing = Differential expression analysis of two conditions/groups was performed using the DESeq R package (1.18.0). The resulting P-values were adjusted using the Benjamini and Hochberg’s approach for controlling the false discovery rate. Genes with an adjusted P-value <0.05 found by DESeq were assigned as differentially expressed
!Sample_data_processing = HTSeq v0.6.1 was used to count the reads numbers mapped to each gene. And then FPKM of each gene was calculated based on the length of the gene and reads count mapped to this gene.
!Sample_data_processing = GO analysis was performed by the GO Annotation of TAIR.
!Sample_data_processing = Reference genome and gene model annotation files were downloaded from genome website directly. Index of the reference genome was built using Bowtie v2.2.3 and paired-end clean reads were aligned to the reference genome using TopHat v2.0.12.
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: 'Feizixiao'. Feizixiao Genome sequencing and assembly can be found in the NCBI database under accession number PRJNA747875.
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: tab-delimited text files include RPKM values for each Sample.
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: tab-delimited text files include RPKM values for each Sample.
